        "original_id": "45cd1cb0-7935-590b-8b85-77f13ffdd188",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Imperator, Vaterland, Bismarck, RMS Majestic\n- Topics: Imperator-class ocean liners, ship size rankings\n\nFacts:\n- The Imperator-class ocean liner trio consisted of Imperator from 1912, Vaterland from 1913, and Bismarck from 1914.\n- Bismarck was the largest ship of the Imperator-class ocean liners.\n- RMS Majestic was the same 1914 ship as Bismarck.\n- At 56,551 gross register tons, RMS Majestic was the largest ship in the world until another ship was completed in 1935.",
